24
00:05:39,498 --> 00:05:52,829
<v Conor> Yes all the same, it's a lot more than wanted to pay .. I didn't really want to go above thirty or forty Anyway, the first one sounds fine for what' need.

25
00:05:52,829 --> 00:05:54,295
